@startuml
title Aircraft Difficulty Template Method Pattern

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDF5
    BorderColor #C9B98F
}

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor #FFF8E7
    BorderColor #7A6A43
    ArrowColor #5D6B75
    FontColor #2F2A22
}

package "template" {
    abstract class Game <<AbstractClass>> {
        + final action(): void
        # updateDifficultyAction(): void
        # createEnemyAircraft(time, bossPresent): AbstractAircraft
        # createBossEnemy(): AbstractAircraft
        # canGenerateBoss(): boolean
        # getBossTriggerScore(): int
    }
}

package "concrete games" {
    class EasyGame <<ConcreteClass>>
    class NormalGame <<ConcreteClass>>
    class HardGame <<ConcreteClass>>
}

Game <|-- EasyGame
Game <|-- NormalGame
Game <|-- HardGame

note right of Game
Template method action() fixes the game loop:
status update, control, difficulty hook,
enemy spawn, shooting, movement,
collision, cleanup, render, result check.
end note

note bottom of EasyGame
No boss generation.
Difficulty remains stable.
end note

note bottom of NormalGame
Enemy spawn cycle, speed,
and HP increase over time.
Boss HP stays fixed.
end note

note bottom of HardGame
Enemy spawn cycle, speed, HP,
hero shoot cycle and enemy shoot
cycle all increase in pressure.
Boss HP increases per summon.
end note

@enduml
